{
  "_comment": "Two independent source types below. aggregator_searches hits TheMuse.com (confirmed reliable, plain server-rendered HTML) with broad keyword+location searches, then the script keeps only lines mentioning one of target_companies. direct_firm_urls hits each firm's own career site directly as a second layer -- verify/replace these yourselves since bank career sites change structure often and several (Goldman, BlackRock, Blackstone) render listings via JavaScript, which is why the script uses a real headless browser (Playwright) to load them, not a plain fetch.",

